{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eP4ztzNPKZ1794380129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新界東豪宅朗濤分行高級分行經理張少聰表示，近期入市氣氛正面，帶動交投，大埔新晉屋苑上然最新錄6座高層A1室，單位實用面積344平方呎，1房間隔，開價約430萬元，議價後以400萬元沽出，實用平均呎價約11,628元。<br/>中原張少聰指，新買家為外區上車客，見單位少有放盤，價錢合理，即入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2025年7月以364萬元購入單位，持貨約1年多，是次易手賬獲利36萬元離場，單位期內升值9.9%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:23:57.676674+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:57:12.129212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:17:15.282285+00:00","content_hash":"7b927c806baf1169c750daa9d5ab1edf6aece1656d6d57dac69052906a41e93b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:23:57.676674+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}